data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"Dispatch d002 is complete and closed. Summary of the work:\n\n- **Merged** `refs/campaign/orchestrator` (3cd2423) into my branch, bringing in `DESIGN.md`.\n- **Built** the Colour Greeting page exactly per the design: React 19 + Vite, `useState` state, `Hello, world!` h1, and three `@codesweep-ai/ui` `Button`s (Blue/Orange/Violet, `variant=\"secondary\"`, `size=\"md\"`) switching the greeting colour through the `--color-cat-1`/`-6`/`-5` tokens — no hex values anywhere. Page wrapped in `AppShell` with its `Header` (title \"Colour Greeting\", no nav/actions) and `Footer`, greeting-plus-buttons centred in the content area.\n- **Configured**: styles imported once at the entry point (core + app-shell + button sheets), dev server bound to `0.0.0.0:5173`, `@codesweep-ai/ui@^0.3.0` installed via npm (version range written by npm, optional peers excluded), `.gitignore` with `node_modules/` and `dist/` in place before the first commit, and a `README.md` documenting the build (`npm run build`) and serve (`npm run serve`) commands.\n- **Verified**: production build passes, dev server confirmed serving on 0.0.0.0:5173, no hex values in source.\n- **Committed** as `871270f` on `cs-sandbox/<DEVELOPER:1>.<GROUP:1>`, and replied with the summary at `~/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md` — the dispatch is now closed."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793343241,"id":"chatcmpl-046141c6","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

